WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.200
Record your voice in the Simple layout. A starter beat is already on a Drums track.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:13.400
Click Add track, then Voice / audio.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:19.000
The Voice track records from your first audio input. The meter shows your microphone.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.200
Wear headphones, so the microphone does not record the beat.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:30.000
Press Record. The first time, choose Audio, into the Playlist as an audio clip.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.600
Press Play, then sing or speak.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Your take is drawn while you record.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:46.000
Press Stop, then Record again to switch recording off.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:51.600
To add an effect, click + in the dock and pick one. Room puts your voice in a room.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.200
Play it back, with the beat.
